<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Congratulations, again! Thank you for your time today. Here is the information we discussed.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Your Next Steps&nbsp;</b></font></div><div><ul><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Log in to <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/">My ASU</a> using your ASURITE ID and password. Please contact our University Technology Office at 480-965-6500 should you experience any difficulty.</li></ul><ul><li>Review your <b>Priority Tasks</b> on My ASU. You will need to complete anything in <font color="#ff0000">red</font>, such as</li><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><li>submitting documentation of your completed MMR vaccinations</li><li>reviewing your <b>Financing Tasks</b> under the Finances heading</li></ul></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">All future communications will be sent to your asu.edu email address. Please set your primary email alias as firstname.lastname@asu.edu. If you need help with this, the technology office is available to assist with this as well.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Again, welcome to the <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/graduate">College of Health Solutions</a> family! It has been a pleasure connecting with you throughout the application process, and I hope you will contact me with any questions or concerns.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Go Devils!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">{!User.Email}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>